      "content": "i dont have time to go look for a clinic right now i'm literally shaking from the pain. i just want to know if there is ANYTHING i can put on it to soothe the heat right now so it stops stinging so much. if i use a little coconut oil or something thick to coat it, wont that protect the skin and keep the air from hitting it? i just need a way to manage this at home until morning.",
